RoBERTa Regression with no Optimization        ----> sentiment_analysis_using_roberta_regression_four.py
RoBERTa Regression with Smooth Data            ----> sentiment_analysis_using_roberta_regression_four_smooth_data.py
RoBERTa Regression with Add Embedding          ----> sentiment_analysis_using_roberta_regression_four_plus_embedding.py
RoBERTa Regression with Add LSTM Layer         ----> sentiment_analysis_using_roberta_regression_four_LSTM.py
RoBERTa Regression with Weighted Accuracy      ----> sentiment_analysis_using_roberta_regression_weighted_accuracy.py
RoBERTa Regression with Data Augmentation      ----> sentiment_analysis_using_roberta_regression_fake_label.py
RoBERTa Classification with no Optimization    ----> sentiment_analysis_using_roberta_classification_four.py
RoBERTa Classification with Smooth Data        ----> sentiment_analysis_using_roberta_classification_four_smooth_data.py
RoBERTa Classification with Add Embedding      ----> sentiment_analysis_using_roberta_classification_four_plus_embedding.py
RoBERTa Classification with Add LSTM Layer     ----> sentiment_analysis_using_roberta_classification_four_LSTM.py
RoBERTa Classification with Data Augmentation  ----> sentiment_analysis_using_roberta_classification_fake_label.py
twitter-RoBERTa  with LSTM Layer               ----> sentiment_analysis_using_twitter_roberta_regression.py
ABSA with LSTM Layer                           ----> sentiment_analysis_using_ABSA_regression_LSTM.py
